~ tongue: bare
~ kernel/test_boot.glo — milestone 2's self-test: speak, then report pass.
invoke "console"

call console_init
speak "glossolalia-os"
speak "the machine listens."
speak 12345
speak 0 subtract by 7
speak "boot ok"
~ qemu's isa-debug-exit turns this into exit status (16 * 2) + 1 = 33
depart 16
